  id: base_dread_control
  title: Control
  description: This spell places a hero under Zargon's control. They can break free
    from the spell immediately or on their next turn by rolling 1 red die for each
    of their spirit points. If they roll a 6, the spell is broken. Until this happens,
    Zargon can move the hero during their turn and use them to attack others.
